# CODEOWNERS — the last rule that matches wins. A ruleset on `main` sets
# `require_code_owner_review`. Read it with `gh api
# repos/dsx-ai-factory/nke/rules/branches/main --jq '[.[].type]'`.
#
# Every rule keeps @dsx-ai-factory/nke-write, so any team member can still approve and no
# rule here blocks a pull request. Remove the team from a line to make it a gate.
#
# Sections mirror the areas in .github/labeler.yml. Order matters: labeler gives
# a file every area it matches, CODEOWNERS gives it one owner set and has no `!`,
# so chart, docs and the second deps block win by coming later.

